uncements/1846018067935216","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4065440-1826362059928429","game_id":"steam-4065440","kind":"announcement","title":"New Gameplay Video Now Available","summary":"Thank you for your continued support. We’ve released a new gameplay video for the game we’re currently developing. This video features gameplay from the early part of the game. We hope it gives you a better sense of the game’s atmosphere and what it actually feels like to play—something that can be difficult to fully convey through text and images alone. Watch the video here: We’ll continue working hard on development to create a game you’ll truly enjoy. Thank you again for your support!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-08T15:08:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059928429","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4065440-1825727806712791","game_id":"steam-4065440","kind":"update","title":"Development Update: New Features in the Works","summary":"This post introduces features that are currently in development for UNDERDEEP.Behavior Policy SettingsYou can set a character’s behavior policy for each tile (coordinate) on the map. During auto-play, characters will prioritize actions that follow the policies assigned to the tile they’re on.Examples of available policies:A: Go NorthC: Go WestE: Use PotionF: Do EvilG: Do goodYou can assign up to two policies per tile.One of the fun parts of the game is experimenting with different setups—routes ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-28T08:36:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806712791","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4065440-1824644522841226","game_id":"steam-4065440","kind":"announcement","title":"UNDERDEEP Crowdfunding Is Now Live!","summary":"Thank you, as always, for your continued support. We’re excited to announce that the UNDERDEEP crowdfunding campaign is now live! Kickstarter (Worldwide) CAMPFIRE (Japan) We’ve put together a range of reward tiers—from early access so you can play early, to customization-focused tiers that let you dive deeper into the world of UNDERDEEP. Whether you want to support the game or simply enjoy UNDERDEEP in a more creative way, we think you’ll find a tier you’ll love. It would also mean a lot if you ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-14T05:11:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522841226","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4065440-1824459501606288","game_id":"steam-4065440","kind":"announcement","title":"Crowdfunding Page Preview Now Live","summary":"Thanks for your continued support!We’ve posted a preview of UNDERDEEP’s crowdfunding page.Kickstarter (Worldwide)CAMPFIRE (Japan)The page includes reward details and a message from the developer—please take a look.On the crowdfunding page, click “Notify me on launch” to get an email when the campaign goes live.Thank you!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-12T09:57:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824459501606288","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4065440-1821922921809970","game_id":"steam-4065440","kind":"update","title":"Release Schedule Update and Crowdfunding Plan","summary":"Thank you as always for your support. I’d like to share the current development status and plans moving forward.Current Development StatusThis project is currently in the middle of core system development, and overall progress is about 30%.I initially aimed to release in Q1 2026, but as development has progressed, I’ve gained a clearer understanding of the work still required. I’ve realized that sticking to a Q1 release would mean cramming too much into too little time, which could result in a p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-14T08:25:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821922921809970","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4065440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:11Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:11Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4065440":"2026-10-26T01:04:11Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4065440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5320420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4065440","app_id":4065440,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:27Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"bcd356826f83947782d20cb3cbabe41c45fee853071eed1f29e872b2cae35c8a","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"UNDERDEEP은 거칠고 몰입감 넘치는 판타지 세계를 배경으로, 던전 탐험과 지도 제작을 깊이 있게 즐길 수 있는 방치형 RPG입니다. 클래식 RPG의 매력과 현대적인 방치형 시스템을 결합해 풍부하고 깊이 있는 게임 경험을 선사합니다.","publishers":[{"name":"Hakony"}],"developers":[{"name":"UNDERDEEP"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":179